1
00:00:02,793 --> 00:00:04,420
I'm Peppa Pig

2
00:00:04,873 --> 00:00:07,140
and this is my little brother, George

3
00:00:07,585 --> 00:00:09,146
This is Mummy Pig

4
00:00:09,867 --> 00:00:11,307
and this is Daddy Pig

5
00:00:13,629 --> 00:00:15,027
I'm Peppa Pig

6
00:00:18,673 --> 00:00:20,899
"Windy Autumn Day"

7
00:00:21,669 --> 00:00:24,156
Today, Peppa and her family are going to the park

8
00:00:24,806 --> 00:00:26,926
It's very cold

9
00:00:27,009 --> 00:00:28,519
It certainly is

10
00:00:28,959 --> 00:00:31,380
Come on, put your warm clothes on

11
00:00:33,063 --> 00:00:34,354
On cold days

12
00:00:34,394 --> 00:00:37,825
Peppa and her family
wear hats, scarves, and coats

13
00:00:38,080 --> 00:00:39,771
Let's put the roof up

14
00:00:40,043 --> 00:00:41,743
And turn the heater on

15
00:00:43,047 --> 00:00:44,769
Is everyone nice and warm?

16
00:00:44,809 --> 00:00:46,331
-Yes, Daddy
-Yes, Daddy

17
00:00:46,892 --> 00:00:48,975
Off we go, then

18
00:00:51,959 --> 00:00:53,275
Here is the park

19
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:54,941
We're here!

20
00:00:54,981 --> 00:00:56,419
-Hooray!
-Hooray!

21
00:00:58,340 --> 00:00:59,153
Mummy

22
00:00:59,193 --> 00:01:02,026
why are all the leaves red and yellow?

23
00:01:02,066 --> 00:01:03,747
Because it's autumn

24
00:01:03,988 --> 00:01:06,309
In autumn, the weather gets colder

25
00:01:06,389 --> 00:01:08,310
and the leaves change colour

26
00:01:11,193 --> 00:01:12,633
It's quite windy

27
00:01:12,674 --> 00:01:14,789
Let's play a game to keep warm

28
00:01:19,054 --> 00:01:20,554
My turn!

29
00:01:21,413 --> 00:01:24,452
Oh, the ball shouldn't go that way

30
00:01:24,972 --> 00:01:26,918
The wind is blowing the ball away

31
00:01:31,091 --> 00:01:33,331
The ball fell into the pond

32
00:01:34,278 --> 00:01:36,838
I'll fish it out with this stick

33
00:01:37,622 --> 00:01:39,599
Reach further, Daddy

34
00:01:39,679 --> 00:01:41,559
Careful, Daddy Pig

35
00:01:42,039 --> 00:01:45,039
Don't worry, almost got it

36
00:01:48,279 --> 00:01:50,961
Daddy, is the water in the pond cold?

37
00:01:51,001 --> 00:01:52,481
A little bit

38
00:01:54,481 --> 00:01:57,042
The wind blew the ball out of the pond

39
00:01:57,082 --> 00:01:58,562
That was lucky!

40
00:01:58,602 --> 00:01:59,540
Yes

41
00:01:59,802 --> 00:02:01,682
We're very lucky

42
00:02:02,235 --> 00:02:04,273
It's getting windier now

43
00:02:04,433 --> 00:02:06,313
Hold on to your hats

44
00:02:07,707 --> 00:02:08,505
Oh dear

45
00:02:08,546 --> 00:02:10,865
The wind blew George's hat away

46
00:02:12,179 --> 00:02:13,718
Don't worry, George

47
00:02:13,759 --> 00:02:15,576
Daddy will get your hat back for you

48
00:02:15,617 --> 00:02:17,237
Go on, Daddy

49
00:02:24,049 --> 00:02:25,054
Look

50
00:02:25,095 --> 00:02:27,105
The hat is up in the tree

51
00:02:27,992 --> 00:02:30,182
Let me climb up and fetch it

52
00:02:30,321 --> 00:02:31,754
This tree is too thin

53
00:02:31,795 --> 00:02:33,957
It won't hold your weight, Daddy Pig

54
00:02:33,997 --> 00:02:36,559
How will we get George's hat back then?

55
00:02:36,599 --> 00:02:39,594
Easy, I'll just shake the tree

56
00:02:43,167 --> 00:02:45,526
Maybe I should shake it a bit harder

57
00:02:52,706 --> 00:02:55,610
I thought that sort of thing only happened to me

58
00:02:55,650 --> 00:02:57,180
It's not funny at all

59
00:02:57,221 --> 00:02:59,489
It is quite funny, Mummy

60
00:02:59,529 --> 00:03:01,742
I suppose it is a bit funny

61
00:03:03,913 --> 00:03:05,401
George, where's your hat?

62
00:03:05,442 --> 00:03:07,242
It's right on your head

63
00:03:08,437 --> 00:03:10,049
Here's your hat, George

64
00:03:10,090 --> 00:03:11,903
Hold onto it tightly this time

65
00:03:13,969 --> 00:03:17,169
The wind has blown all the leaves off the trees

66
00:03:17,344 --> 00:03:18,689
Look at me

67
00:03:18,768 --> 00:03:21,014
The wind is holding me up

68
00:03:21,839 --> 00:03:24,200
The wind is strong enough to hold Peppa up

69
00:03:26,282 --> 00:03:28,636
The wind is strong enough to hold George up

70
00:03:28,862 --> 00:03:30,604
You try it too, Daddy

71
00:03:31,565 --> 00:03:32,926
I might be a bit too heavy

72
00:03:32,966 --> 00:03:34,327
Come on, Daddy

73
00:03:34,607 --> 00:03:36,128
It's really fun

74
00:03:36,168 --> 00:03:37,900
Oh, all right then

75
00:03:38,193 --> 00:03:41,213
The wind is even strong enough to hold Daddy Pig up

76
00:03:42,454 --> 00:03:44,897
This is lots of fun

77
00:03:45,058 --> 00:03:46,461
Mummy, come on

78
00:03:46,502 --> 00:03:47,661
You try it too

79
00:03:47,863 --> 00:03:50,992
If the wind stops, I'll fall down

80
00:03:51,638 --> 00:03:54,366
The wind won't stop suddenly

81
00:03:54,913 --> 00:03:56,595
The wind has stopped

82
00:04:00,235 --> 00:04:01,644
It's not funny at all

83
00:04:01,684 --> 00:04:03,950
But it is really funny

84
00:04:06,213 --> 00:04:07,869
Now that the wind has stopped

85
00:04:08,062 --> 00:04:09,622
what should we do?

86
00:04:10,283 --> 00:04:12,542
What's your favourite game?

87
00:04:12,582 --> 00:04:15,575
Jumping up and down in muddy puddles

88
00:04:16,261 --> 00:04:18,530
But there aren't any muddy puddles here

89
00:04:18,661 --> 00:04:21,501
There are only dry, boring leaves everywhere

90
00:04:21,541 --> 00:04:24,306
So what are dry leaves good for?

91
00:04:24,643 --> 00:04:26,142
I don't know

92
00:04:26,183 --> 00:04:28,506
Jumping up and down on them

93
00:04:28,747 --> 00:04:32,111
Daddy Pig loves jumping up and down in the leaves

94
00:04:32,184 --> 00:04:35,216
Peppa loves jumping up and down in the leaves

95
00:04:35,330 --> 00:04:38,533
Everyone loves jumping up and down in the leaves

96
00:04:38,643 --> 00:04:41,976
This is the best autumn day ever
